couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[65,58,52,35,60,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[65,58,52,35,60,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10074","city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[65,58,52,35,60,55],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1001205","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年长广县（今山东莱西附近）人，是活动于青州北海、东莱一带的海贼首领。其聚众达三千余家，在沿海地区为害。长广太守何夔认为强攻不易，主张徐喻以恩德。派郡丞黄珍前去陈说利害，管承于是请求降服。但后来其降而复叛。建安十一年八月，曹操决定彻底解决隐患，亲征至淳于（今山东安丘东北），派乐进、李典进攻。曹军数战数捷，管承大败，逃入海岛。","tc":"東漢末年長廣縣（今山東萊西附近）人，是活動于青州北海、東萊一帶的海賊首領。其聚眾達三千余家，在沿海地區為害。長廣太守何夔認為強攻不易，主張徐喻以恩德。派郡丞黃珍前去陳說利害，管承于是請求降服。但后來其降而復叛。建安十一年八月，曹操決定徹底解決隱患，親征至淳于（今山東安丘東北），派樂進、李典進攻。曹軍數戰數捷，管承大敗，逃入海島。","en":"A native of Changguang County (near present-day Laixi, Shandong) in the late Eastern Han dynasty, he was a pirate leader who operated across Beihai and Donglai in Qing Province. Gathering a following of over three thousand households, he wreaked havoc along the coastal regions. He Kui, the Governor of Changguang, believed that taking him by force would be difficult and advocated winning him over gradually with benevolence. He sent Assistant Governor Huang Zhen to explain the advantages and perils, whereupon Guan Cheng petitioned to surrender. However, Guan Cheng later rebelled anew. In the eighth month of the eleventh year of Jianan, Cao Cao resolved to eradicate the threat once and for all. Leading an expedition in person to Chunyu (northeast of modern Anqiu, Shandong), he dispatched Yue Jin and Li Dian to attack. The Cao forces won battle after battle, Guan Cheng was utterly defeated and fled to an island in the sea.","jp":"後漢末期の長広県（現在の山東省莱西付近）の人物で、青州の北海・東莱一帯で活動した海賊の頭領。三千余家を集めて徒党を組み、沿海地域を荒らし回った。長広太守の何夔は強攻は得策ではないと考え、恩徳を以て徐々に諭すべきだと主張した。郡丞の黄珍を遣わして利害を説かせると、管承は降服を願い出たが、後に再び背いた。建安十一年八月、曹操は後患を完全に断つことを決断し、自ら淳于（現在の山東省安丘北東）へ親征して楽進や李典を攻撃に向かわせた。曹軍が連戦連勝したため、管承は大敗して海島へと逃走した。","kr":"후한 말 장광현(지금의 산동 내서 부근) 사람으로, 청주 북해와 동래 일대에서 활동하던 해적 두목이다. 무리가 3천여 가구에 달했으며 연해 지역에서 큰 피해를 입혔다. 장광태수 하규가 강공으로는 토벌하기 어렵다고 여겨 은덕으로 서서히 타일러야 한다고 주장했다. 군승 황진을 보내 이해득실을 설파하게 하자 관승은 이에 투항을 청했으나, 이후 다시 배반했다. 건안 11년 8월, 조조는 후환을 완전히 뿌리 뽑고자 친히 순우(지금의 산동 안구 동북쪽)까지 출정하여 악진과 이전을 보내 공격하게 했다. 조조군이 연전연승을 거두자 관승은 대패하여 바다 섬으로 달아났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1052215","remark":"普武","surname":"管","surnameTc":"管","surnameEn":"Guan","surnameJp":"管","surnameKr":"관","surnameOther":"","name":"承","nameTc":"承","nameEn":"Cheng","nameJp":"承","nameKr":"승","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"管承","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1070","gender":"0","rule":"65","force":"58","wise":"52","politics":"35","charm":"60","will":"55","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"29/58/34/30/30/23/33/29","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1013005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSo